            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-description field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Belltown Dome is a covered natural ice pad located in the Britannia area of Bay Ward. In the winter residents can enjoy ice skating and ice sports. In the summer the arena is used for other sports such as ball hockey and lacrosse. Schedules are posted below.</p>
<p>Ice conditions are weather dependent. Watch this page for updates about closures during the winter months when fluctuating temperatures impact ice conditions.&nbsp;</p>
<p>Belltown Dome is available to rent. See the Rentals section below.</p></div>
      

